Units changed: umainform.

After the release: [Startup] Mode (a user's request, via the author)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
"apparently the best start-up mode is side by side with tc ... instead of
Fullscreen=0/1 ... Mode=0/1/2; 0: start with ini [default], 1: start full
screen with last dir (fallback program dir), 2: start side by side with TC."
- [Startup] Mode replaces StartFullscreen (StartFullscreen=1 becomes Mode=1,
  the old key is removed at the next save). 0 = as before; 1 = without a
  file the viewer fullscreen in the last session (none: MView's own
  folder), with a file fullscreen; 2 = the same, then side by side with
  Total Commander in the start folder (queued until the window is up).
- TConfig.StartMode / StartFullscreen / StartsViewer; TMainForm.FormCreate
  decides settings screen or viewer; FormShow starts, StartSideBySide;
  ToggleSideBySide takes the start folder when no image is shown yet.
Units changed: uConfig, umainform. Spec §11, §14.

